{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Carol V.","Carla V."],"summary":"The analyst note states that Carol V. and Carla V. may be aliases for one person or may be distinct individuals. The coreference remains unresolved, and the note recommends obtaining platform account records before selecting a canonical identity.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-analyst-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/analysis/coreference-note"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Carol V.","RedFox"],"summary":"A supplied profile excerpt uses the display name Carol V. and includes a sentence denying knowledge of the RedFox message. Because the profile is not authenticated to the platform account in the packet, the denial remains a source claim rather than a verified exculpatory finding.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-profile-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/profile/carol-v"}]},{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["Carla V.","RedFox"],"summary":"A witness addendum reports hearing the name Carla V. near the time of the message but not remembering the exact minute and not being able to confirm that Carla used the RedFox handle. The account supports an alternative identity claim without resolving the identity or chronology ambiguity.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-witness-002","source_locator":"case-c-scale/witness/addendum-1"}]},{"timestamp_text":"2026-03-04 15:20 UTC","participants":["RedFox"],"summary":"The preservation log records collection of the platform export at 2026-03-04 15:20 UTC and storage under evidence package E-01. This is a collection and chain-of-custody record and does not establish when the RedFox message was sent or who controlled the handle.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"c-preservation-001","source_locator":"case-c-scale/preservation/export-01"}]}]}